# QA M5 flow (D-017, D-075): game over after the lantern checkpoint, then
# continue restarts the Wolfgangsee from its start with the scroll reset.
# Title flow (play from 171). wolfgangsee_checkpoint's first 2300 frames:
# the solver route under the pontoon (checkpoint 2389), Gelse #1 stings
# her (death 1 at 2448). Twice: respawn on the pontoon (intro, 60-frame
# hold), walk to its end, hop the bollard into the lake and float at the
# surface, pushed by the edge, until Gelse #2 stings her (deaths 2 and 3
# at 3409 and 4370). Game over at 4430; START at 5042 continues: the stage
# intro, then play at the St. Wolfgang quay (x 34, camera x 0 in the
# lead-in, 3 lives, score and Oblaten 0, the checkpoint cleared). The
# solver's notch hop then starts the scroll again and she rides the
# Dampfer (x >= 400).
